2026-10-13T22:59:43.3181300Z 22:59:43.317 [warning] [Operator] The instance-operator allowlist is UNSET (BARKPARK_OPERATOR_EMAILS and BARKPARK_OPERATOR_TOKEN_IDS are
2026-10-13T22:59:43.3183331Z both empty), so the `admin` permission alone still opens these eight INSTANCE-GLOBAL
2026-10-13T22:59:43.3184760Z route groups to ANY admin-permissioned token, including one whose only membership is an
2026-10-13T22:59:43.3185859Z admin seat in a single workspace:
2026-10-13T22:59:43.3187461Z   1. POST|GET /v1/admin/self-update, POST /v1/admin/rollback, POST|GET /v1/admin/site-deploy
2026-10-13T22:59:43.3188673Z   2. GET /v1/plugins
2026-10-13T22:59:43.3189395Z   3. GET|PUT|DELETE /v1/plugins/settings/:plugin_name
2026-10-13T22:59:43.3190669Z   4. GET /v1/secrets, GET /v1/secrets/:name, GET /v1/secrets/:name/audit,
2026-10-13T22:59:43.3191570Z      PUT /v1/secrets/:name, DELETE /v1/secrets/:name
2026-10-13T22:59:43.3192468Z   5. POST /v1/status/incidents, POST /v1/status/incidents/:id/resolve
2026-10-13T22:59:43.3193243Z   6. POST /api/playground
2026-10-13T22:59:43.3193870Z   7. POST /api/workspaces/:workspace_slug/import
2026-10-13T22:59:43.3194658Z   8. GET /v1/instance/site-deploy, GET /v1/instance/metrics
2026-10-13T22:59:43.3196071Z On a SINGLE-TENANT instance that is fine — the only admin is the operator. On a
